    "scenesThatPass": [
      "JOE: You're a couple o' sticks[2] shy in your column, Ann.\nJOE: Did you get it, too?\nANN: Yeah. You, too? Oh, Joe . . . oh, I'm sorry darling . . . why don't we tear the building down!\nJOE: Before you do, Ann, perhaps you'd better finish this column.",
      "ANN: If you're thinking of that thousand dollars, forget it. It's practically gone. We owed everybody in town. Now, you've just gotta stop giving…\nMRS. MITCHELL: Oh, Ann, dear!\nANN: Oh, I'm sorry, Ma. Oh, don't pay any attention to me. I guess I'm just upset about all this. Gee whiz, here I am with a great opportunity to…",
      "ANN: Oh—they're laughing at me!\nMRS. MITCHELL: Whom are you calling now? You called that number not ten minutes ago!",
      "ANN: Thank you.\nMRS. MITCHELL: Why, Ann! . . ."
    ]
  },
